  "content": "\n\n<p><strong>Этот мод&nbsp;</strong><br>Содержит рецепты создания блоков коралла из всё более мелких фрагментов кораллов</p>\n<hr>\n<p><em><strong>Рецепты</strong></em><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/998996/description_18dda611-64ec-4345-b7df-8481990f32fb.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"232\" height=\"109\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/998996/description_476332d9-fdd7-4704-afcd-e2eb5e8b323c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"231\" height=\"109\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/998996/description_e5217d4d-dffd-4f53-93a9-c27d31bdc253.png\" width=\"231\" height=\"109\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/998996/description_03689468-8c62-4685-88d1-c74b4ada180e.png\" width=\"232\" height=\"109\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/998996/description_d930e781-723a-4283-a8da-a285aaec0516.png\" width=\"232\" height=\"109\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/998996/description_66665f07-9581-4c69-8932-3de43fc140a2.png\" width=\"232\" height=\"109\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/998996/description_8277576b-5b25-4a48-99e4-65586a2ccdf0.png\" width=\"226\" height=\"106\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/998996/description_8e059020-49e8-44a4-9687-f7fdb61b3b5c.png\" width=\"225\" height=\"106\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/998996/description_0ad77073-efde-4f83-a76d-c2aa0acd0888.png\" width=\"226\" height=\"106\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/998996/description_bd9fad18-0987-4ef6-84e4-34e418bc6b8e.png\" width=\"225\" height=\"106\"></p>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>мод создан с помощью MCreator студией Hrajto Studio</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>",
